<script>

/* =========================================================
   Wired to live Shopify variants (product: Custom Embroidered Hat).
   Tier format: [min qty, price per hat, Shopify variant ID]
   If you change prices, change them BOTH here and in Shopify admin.

   IMAGES, each style rotates through its `imgs` array. Swap in
   your colorway photos (Shopify admin > Content > Files, paste URLs).
   COLORS, condensed to sourcing-friendly basics: Otto top 15,
   Richardson top 20, Atonal 3 camos, YP 6006 full list (popular
   controls how many chips show before the "+ more" toggle).
   Add/remove names freely, swatches generate automatically.
   ========================================================= */
const STYLES = [
